      "text": "ye devour widows’ houses, Matt. 23:14 (Mark 12:40; Luke 20:47). poor widow hath cast more in, than all, Mark 12:43 (Luke 21:3). was a widow of about fourscore and four years, Luke 2:37. many widows were in Israel in the days of Elias, Luke 4:25. Elias sent … unto a woman that was a widow, Luke 4:26. there was a widow in that city, Luke 18:3. their widows were neglected in the daily ministration, Acts 6:1. I say therefore to the unmarried and widows, 1 Cor. 7:8. Honour widows that are widows indeed, 1 Tim. 5:3. visit the fatherless and widows in their affliction, James 1:27.",
